{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50899","headline":"礼聂先生新安重围先生能通两军之好及城开民皆复全也 · 王贞白","name":"礼聂先生新安重围先生能通两军之好及城开民皆复全也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"李白辞翰苑，前山寻隐沦。\n不遇采芝翁，满洞惟白云。\n（原注：李白昔日曾於此山寻许宣平先生不遇。\n）我来礼先生，得与龟鹤亲。\n学道须有缘，始逢天上人。\n四皓安汉室，先生存歙民。\n阴功数已满，自合成天真。\n如何未上昇，应待玉皇迎。\n我愿去浮名，随师归三清。\n（此见《永乐大典》卷一○四五九「四济」「礼」字〖十一函一百四册〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}